Digital Readiness Senior Technologist at ministry of ict and innovation (MINICT).

Responsibilities or duties,

Formulate, assess and review strategies and policies for the development of digital readiness competencies in Rwandans to thrive in a digital future;

Develop and maintain a good and extensive network of partners and relationships across public, private sectors, that will help to enhance the quality and extend the reach of digital readiness programmes for Rwandans;

