COOPERATIVE MINIERE KABABARA-GIKINGO (COMIKAGI): TIN: 101773235

ITANGAZO

Ubuyobozi bwa COMIKAGI, Koperative ikora ubucukuzi bw’amabuye y’agaciro mu Murenge wa Ruli, Akarere ka Gakenke, Intara y’Amajyaruguru buramenyesha ababyifuza bose kandi bujuje ibisabwa ko bwifuza gutanga akazi ku mwanya wa Mining Engineer ba Koperative COMIKAGI. Dore ibisabwa kubifuza gupiganira uyu mwanya:

MNING ENGINEER

Kuba afite impamyabushobozi ya kaminuza mu bucukuzi bw’amabuye y’ agaciro (Ao muri Mining);

 Kuba inyangamugayo;

Kuba avuga neza ikinyarwanda n’icyongereza cyangwa igifaransa;

 Kuba ari umunyarwandaKuba afite impamyabushobozi ya kaminuza mu bucukuzi bw’amabuye y’agaciro (mining);

 Kuba inyangamugayo;

Kuba avuga neza ikinyarwanda n’icyongereza cyangwa igifaransa; Kuba ari umunyarwanda

INSHINGANO

Gukurikirana ubucukuzi n’ubushakakashatsi muri koperative COMIKAGI

 Agenzura niba ahakorerwa ubucukuzi hubahirizwa gahunda yashyizweho na Leta yo gucukura hubahirizwa ibipimo no kwita kubuzima n’umutekano by’abakozi (Safety and Healthy)

 Kugenzura ko amazi y’imigezi atanduzwa mu gihe cy’ubucukuzi : no kureba ko ibyobo biyungurura  amazi bitunganywa;

Gutegura no kwigisha uburyo bw’ubucukuzi bwubahirije ubuziranenge (standards) z’icyerekezo cyiza mu bucukuzi hagamijwe kongera umusaruro;

Gutegura haba mu nyigo no mu buryo buciriritse uburyo bwo gucukura no gutunganya amabuye

Kumenya umunsi ku munsi ishusho y’ibibazo n’ibisubizo mu by’ubucukuzi n’ubushakashatsi muri Koperative COMIKAGI ndetse n ‘ingorane zihariye n’ibitekerezo by’uko zakemuka;

 Gutegura no gutekereza imishinga n’ibikoresho mu by’ubucukuzi n’ubushakashatsi

Kumenya imiterere y’ubucukuzi n’ubushakashatsi mu rwego mpuzamahanga

 Gutegura cyangwa kwiga uburyo bwo kurushaho kongera agaciro k’ amabuye y’agaciro

Gutegura, gukurikirana no gufasha koperative COMIKAGI gusaba no kongeresha ibyangombwa by’ubucukuzi no ku bibazo bijyana nabyo;

Gutegura cyangwa kwamamaza intambwe itewe mu mikorere y’ubucukuzi muri koperative COMIKAGI hakoreshejwe uburyo bwemewe n’ amategeko;

Gutanga raporo y’ibikorwa byakozwe n’iteganyabikorwa ashingiye kuri gahunda ye y’ibikorwa yateganyije mbere bigashyikirizwa umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa koperative COMIKAGI

Guhuza ibikorwa by’ubucukuzi muri koperative COMIKAGI no gutekereza cyane mu nyandiko ibibazo n’ ingamba ziganisha ku gisubizo hagamijwe kongera umusaruro.

