7) Inyandiko zigaragaza uburambe mu kazi.

Fine Fish Ltd, is looking to hire four (4) employees who meet the following criteria:

Of Rwandan nationality;

Good conduct, life and morals;

Between the ages of 25 and 35;

High school diploma in accounting;

University degree in accounting with a higher qualification (Fist Class or Second Class Upper Division);

Work experience of at least 2 years in accounting is an advantage

